cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Smart Spatial System"
abstract: >-
  A plugin-based GeoAI backend that turns a natural-language geospatial
  question into a structured QuerySpec, plans it as a DAG of spatial
  operations, executes it via vector/raster/PostGIS/reporting plugins
  against uploads or PostGIS, and returns map-ready outputs with a full
  execution trace. Includes a deterministic, rule-based planning path
  alongside an LLM-backed one, and a React/Leaflet workbench.
authors:
